<section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">OUR PURPOSE</p><h1>Stronger roots.<br /><em>A more resilient future.</em></h1><p>We believe African farmers should have access to information that helps them care for their crops, their resources, and their livelihoods.</p></section>
  <section class="purpose" id="our-purpose">
    <div class="purpose-photograph"><img class="" src="/images/harvest.jpg" alt="Baskets of fresh green vegetables and carrots" loading="lazy" width="1600" height="1067" /><span>ROOTED IN POSSIBILITY.</span></div><div class="purpose-copy"><p class="eyebrow light">03 / ROOTED IN AFRICA</p><h2>A future that<br />grows with<br /><em>our farmers.</em></h2><p>Resilient agriculture begins with the people who grow our food. Talazo’s mission is to make agricultural intelligence more accessible to African farmers.</p><p>We’re building towards healthier crops, more thoughtful resource use, and farming that can better respond to a changing climate.</p><a class="text-link" href="/join-pilot">Help shape what comes next <span>↗</span></a></div>
